# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# react-native-mesh-sdk — .gitignore
#
# What IS committed: our wrapper (src/, android/src/main/java/com/meshsdk,
# ios/MeshSdk*.{swift,m}), the vendored Core BitChat under
# android/src/main/java/{com/bitchat,info,org} + ios/{bitchat,localPackages}
# (incl. the Arti native binaries) so the repo is self-contained and buildable,
# plus scripts and docs.
#
# What is IGNORED: dependencies, build outputs, caches and machine-specific
# files (they are regenerated by npm install / gradle / pod install).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
# NOTE: package-lock.json / Podfile.lock / Package.resolved ARE committed
#       (they pin versions) — do not ignore them.

# ── JS / TypeScript build output ─────────────────────────────
lib/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Logs & misc ──────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
.metro-health-check*
.expo/

# ── Android (library + example) ──────────────────────────────
build/
.gradle/
.kotlin/
.cxx/
*.iml
*.hprof
# Machine-specific SDK location (auto-generated by Gradle/Android Studio).
local.properties
# Keystores — the shared debug.keystore IS committed; ignore real signing keys.
*.jks
release.keystore

# ── iOS / Xcode (library + example) ──────────────────────────
ios/Pods/
example/ios/Pods/
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
# Machine-specific NODE_BINARY / watchman / PATH overrides (per RN convention).
.xcode.env.local

# ── OS / editors ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
